{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/extras/a9c248dfa627ede0445021f3828e47b9.avif?t=1773137124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blessed Fool</strong> is a profound point-and-click adventure where you are not only tasked with saving the townsfolk but also delving into the depths of human mystery to uncover who spreads terror in this eerie city. Your journey will take you through foul-smelling streets, crumbling homes, overcrowded cemeteries, libraries, and ominous monasteries. You'll help people whose lives are bound by shared fear and hope to unravel the mystery that has shrouded the entire town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep narrative</strong> offering numerous interpretations of events and their hidden meanings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/extras/233d60efdbf177d3ce3fe42514db4d24.poster.avif?t=1773137124\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/extras/233d60efdbf177d3ce3fe42514db4d24.webm?t=1773137124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/extras/233d60efdbf177d3ce3fe42514db4d24.mp4?t=1773137124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique characters</strong>, including disabled individuals, soldiers, madmen, holy fools, bell ringers, and monks \u2014 each living in a world of suffering, fear, and violence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique soundtrack</strong> that intensifies the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living city</strong> with its own history, traditions, craftsmanship, and faith.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be warned</strong>: the game will challenge not only your logic but also your inner peace \u2014 immersing you in an atmosphere of pressure, anxiety, and stress, as though it becomes your adversary.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396560?t=1773137124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396560?t=1773137124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/deb30cc16091916910906f9de5c561e8e3e0056d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773137124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/deb30cc16091916910906f9de5c561e8e3e0056d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773137124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396560/extras/a9c248dfa627ede0445021f3828e47b9.avif?t=1773137124\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Blessed Fool</strong> is a profound point-and-click adventure where you are not only tasked with saving the townsfolk but also delving into the depths of human mystery to uncover who spreads terror in this eerie city. Your journey will take you through foul-smelling streets, crumbling homes, overcrowded cemeteries, libraries, and ominous monasteries. You'll help people whose lives are bound by shared fear and hope to unravel the mystery that has shrouded the entire town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep narrative</strong> offering numerous i